OL,3,GNEWSAGleaning group gives #1m of
OL,4,Aproduce to food banks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gleaning group has saved #1m worth of
OL,7,Ffruit and vegetables that would have
OL,8,Fbeen left in field and donated them to
OL,9,Ffood banks.
OL,11,FGleaning Cornwall relies on volunteers
OL,12,Fto collect unwanted produce from
OL,13,Fharvested fields, delivering it to 160
OL,14,Ffood banks, community larders and
OL,15,Fkitchens across the South West.
OL,17,FDespite reaching the seven-figure
OL,18,Fmilestone, the group has warned more
OL,19,Ffunding is needed in order to keep up
OL,20,Fwith demand.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
