OL,3,GNEWSAGleaning group gives #1m of
OL,4,Aproduce to food banks
OL,5,
OL,6,FReliance on food banks is increasing
OL,7,Fand since 2015 the number of known
OL,8,Fsettings providing food aid in Cornwall
OL,9,Fhas risen from 20 to 180, according to
OL,10,FCornwall Council.
